    {
      "id": "u_53bd0ea7bc3554960967faa2_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Trilium supports creating __TRILIUM_PH_0__Code__TRILIUM_PH_1__ notes, i.e. notes which allow you to store some programming code and highlight it. Special case is JavaScript code notes which can also be executed inside Trilium which can in conjunction with __TRILIUM_PH_2__Script API__TRILIUM_PH_3__ provide extra functionality.",
      "sourceHash": "53bd0ea7bc3554960967faa284ea3950eac6f856701f1dd0b0573300429659e6",
      "context": "Scripting",
      "contextHash": "01846401bd51c6304510b9e2350e45b81678afd5c1b9e937e2f976b0e7127e69",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_585e2345f781f738720523ad_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Architecture Overview__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "585e2345f781f738720523ad141ee9f3756a8cc85c0102e671a45fe36b71fcfd",
      "context": "Scripting > Architecture Overview",
      "contextHash": "e5c8cbfe7ea8142ea9c8ae64a18531b4a6823d25dbe0ae4d2bf173e7d86392cd",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_aa6aa6c306ac9fd87eef1d11_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To go further I must explain basic architecture of Trilium - in its essence it is a classic web application - it has these two main components:",
      "sourceHash": "aa6aa6c306ac9fd87eef1d114f953d87f92da6ca7e7c8ceea2cdbebb91ba344d",
      "context": "Scripting > Architecture Overview",
      "contextHash": "e5c8cbfe7ea8142ea9c8ae64a18531b4a6823d25dbe0ae4d2bf173e7d86392cd",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_89f237fbd5faa934840ed39a_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "frontend running in the browser (using HTML, CSS, JavaScript) - this is mainly used to interact with the user, display notes etc.",
      "sourceHash": "89f237fbd5faa934840ed39ab9451a6f7641899ce1c2b6de56f8a876f0d13e8d",
      "context": "Scripting > Architecture Overview",
      "contextHash": "e5c8cbfe7ea8142ea9c8ae64a18531b4a6823d25dbe0ae4d2bf173e7d86392cd",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_3fe7934785e3b116146dc078_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "backend running JavaScript code in node.js runtime - this is responsible for e.g. storing notes, encrypting them etc.",
      "sourceHash": "3fe7934785e3b116146dc07875c417aac5553d422160113034feb0e289ef4b4d",
      "context": "Scripting > Architecture Overview",
      "contextHash": "e5c8cbfe7ea8142ea9c8ae64a18531b4a6823d25dbe0ae4d2bf173e7d86392cd",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a69c24073a58e8dfcd6bbb64_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "So we have frontend and backend, each with their own set of responsibilities, but their common feature is that they both run JavaScript code. Add to this the fact, that we're able to create JavaScript __TRILIUM_PH_0__Code__TRILIUM_PH_1__ and we're onto something.",
      "sourceHash": "a69c24073a58e8dfcd6bbb644f5e6b2a37d4e44a97de5c0de0df785d580c5805",
      "context": "Scripting > Architecture Overview",
      "contextHash": "e5c8cbfe7ea8142ea9c8ae64a18531b4a6823d25dbe0ae4d2bf173e7d86392cd",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a95610bb37953af2f48b30aa_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Use cases__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "a95610bb37953af2f48b30aa6d0afc9a30fb6e1debde55d62bd3fd453c8986c7",
      "context": "Scripting > Use cases",
      "contextHash": "660b6ad6c0c1f5e730cd41b201ebfb23c00562da00aff88a80903d817edcbcbf",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_71874b800bc128a91cbc67c6_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__\"New Task\" launcher button__TRILIUM_PH_1__",
      "sourceHash": "71874b800bc128a91cbc67c644a0b8121056e10557ac5d53a6d9b9b177263220",
      "context": "Scripting > Use cases",
      "contextHash": "660b6ad6c0c1f5e730cd41b201ebfb23c00562da00aff88a80903d817edcbcbf",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_667f19adc09c425e2af8b887_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Action handler__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "667f19adc09c425e2af8b8871f43c88c3d112c584009e3aba807dc17465d6d91",
      "context": "Scripting > Action handler",
      "contextHash": "606d09cbf3b8704c2961d51b776cefaae3b97e47ba768177f7c148793020166b",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_3411002b498d9f28193249ab_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Saving the note to the database is backend's responsibility, so we immediately pass control to the backend and ask it to create a note. Once this is done, we show the newly created note so that the user can set the task title and maybe some attributes.",
      "sourceHash": "3411002b498d9f28193249abea15db833161b9385a4fe65b1025e5fc41850181",
      "context": "Scripting > Action handler",
      "contextHash": "606d09cbf3b8704c2961d51b776cefaae3b97e47ba768177f7c148793020166b",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_9e79dc77e7d9d4ad2ce94bcd_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Script execution__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "9e79dc77e7d9d4ad2ce94bcd46b40bf057c2d802e9963cb74f25309328e2f9b3",
      "context": "Scripting > Script execution",
      "contextHash": "36cbfa80504f7c82480d0c535ca6a2ed1289050d82e3bdb2c5b8aec0745e7540",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_492cc30f02a0ac3652bbf788_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "So we have a script which will add the button to the toolbar. But how can we execute it? One possibility is to click on the __TRILIUM_PH_0__ __TRILIUM_PH_1__Execute script__TRILIUM_PH_2__ button. The problem with this is that this UI change is time bound by Trilium runtime so when we restart Trilium, button won't be there.",
      "sourceHash": "492cc30f02a0ac3652bbf7880ff6317dcf95cb35190f19eaba28e54e9ddcc30d",
      "context": "Scripting > Script execution",
      "contextHash": "36cbfa80504f7c82480d0c535ca6a2ed1289050d82e3bdb2c5b8aec0745e7540",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_5ccd630b96dcf38290e77932_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "We need to execute it every time Trilium starts up, but we probably don't want to have to manually click on play button on every start up.",
      "sourceHash": "5ccd630b96dcf38290e7793293bda07d84820faaf982eb8f17caf9b3cf016028",
      "context": "Scripting > Script execution",
      "contextHash": "36cbfa80504f7c82480d0c535ca6a2ed1289050d82e3bdb2c5b8aec0745e7540",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_85cd0d82f0c3c6fb3e4d53ac_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The solution is to give the note the __TRILIUM_PH_0__label__TRILIUM_PH_1__ __TRILIUM_PH_2__ - this is one of the \"system\" labels which Trilium understands. As you might guess, this will cause all such labeled script notes to be executed once Trilium frontend starts up.",
      "sourceHash": "85cd0d82f0c3c6fb3e4d53ac4e510e909e124da523991e44b2fff75ea3bd2aae",
      "context": "Scripting > Script execution",
      "contextHash": "36cbfa80504f7c82480d0c535ca6a2ed1289050d82e3bdb2c5b8aec0745e7540",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_47684de4880ba21d36e731ed_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "(__TRILIUM_PH_0__ does not work for __TRILIUM_PH_1__Mobile frontend__TRILIUM_PH_2__ - if you want to have scripts running there, give the script __TRILIUM_PH_3__ label).",
      "sourceHash": "47684de4880ba21d36e731ed822a69aa564b6416d4fd259c56e22215b7c08099",
      "context": "Scripting > Script execution",
      "contextHash": "36cbfa80504f7c82480d0c535ca6a2ed1289050d82e3bdb2c5b8aec0745e7540",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_d0f1b31b94ce723f839fa75f_0",
      "kind": "h3",
      "source": "Execute button__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "d0f1b31b94ce723f839fa75f98fb547ab71c22475059bd07516d632698181674",
      "context": "Scripting > Script execution > Execute button",
      "contextHash": "8e862a379ee9adeec989a2f6121633425d531c1f35a9eca71e40e52e12ac938b",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_eee3e261d9266826493d1881_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Runnable code notes (frontend or backend) and saved SQL consoles can optionally have a dedicated __TRILIUM_PH_0__ execute button alongside a description.",
      "sourceHash": "eee3e261d9266826493d1881ae0c6110852fe8ddad929d1f3b0778c6c935bc00",
      "context": "Scripting > Script execution > Execute button",
      "contextHash": "8e862a379ee9adeec989a2f6121633425d531c1f35a9eca71e40e52e12ac938b",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_d1349f779c40e151cf899280_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To do so, apply the following __TRILIUM_PH_0__labels__TRILIUM_PH_1__:",
      "sourceHash": "d1349f779c40e151cf89928060996d64b66f0cb344c53c9430ec9c506e5b69b4",
      "context": "Scripting > Script execution > Execute button",
      "contextHash": "8e862a379ee9adeec989a2f6121633425d531c1f35a9eca71e40e52e12ac938b",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_707733b9531cc655cc7026f2_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "A __TRILIUM_PH_0__ with the value of the label being displayed as the label of the button.",
      "sourceHash": "707733b9531cc655cc7026f2d27a2e635f43a096a68c33af68287994086743bd",
      "context": "Scripting > Script execution > Execute button",
      "contextHash": "8e862a379ee9adeec989a2f6121633425d531c1f35a9eca71e40e52e12ac938b",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_9fe7f63164e974e5b8539b95_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "An optional __TRILIUM_PH_0__ which adds explanatory text beside it.",
      "sourceHash": "9fe7f63164e974e5b8539b95dd7c50ceafb72a480de6f365945fa511e32349b8",
      "context": "Scripting > Script execution > Execute button",
      "contextHash": "8e862a379ee9adeec989a2f6121633425d531c1f35a9eca71e40e52e12ac938b",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a2a029df6ea856dbef2a101f_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Autocomplete & linting__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "a2a029df6ea856dbef2a101ff8f2571b35c5b9eeb08846f34a24de8c9539ddf3",
      "context": "Scripting > Autocomplete & linting",
      "contextHash": "263bc05830d9e5b724d8ed55f90507179bd7161ab435d12efd9ae9651683ae4d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_45cdbf801f3e9a69343bec5f_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Starting with Trilium v0.104.0, frontend scripts, backend scripts and render notes benefit from an autocomplete system.",
      "sourceHash": "45cdbf801f3e9a69343bec5f3e0231707ed30cacb40b83dbf081645a96dc74a2",
      "context": "Scripting > Autocomplete & linting",
      "contextHash": "263bc05830d9e5b724d8ed55f90507179bd7161ab435d12efd9ae9651683ae4d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ba931d3b4df57b3e47174448_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The autocomplete opens automatically while typing a name or after a __TRILIUM_PH_0__.__TRILIUM_PH_1__, or manually by pressing __TRILIUM_PH_2__Ctrl__TRILIUM_PH_3__+__TRILIUM_PH_4__Space__TRILIUM_PH_5__. Its list looks and works like the __TRILIUM_PH_6__/__TRILIUM_PH_7__ list of a text note: each entry has an icon for its kind (function, property, class…), __TRILIUM_PH_8__Enter__TRILIUM_PH_9__ or __TRILIUM_PH_10__Tab__TRILIUM_PH_11__ inserts the highlighted one and __TRILIUM_PH_12__Esc__TRILIUM_PH_13__ closes it.",
      "sourceHash": "ba931d3b4df57b3e471744486b722870f7b343a230f683c8bac877e8948fb647",
      "context": "Scripting > Autocomplete & linting",
      "contextHash": "263bc05830d9e5b724d8ed55f90507179bd7161ab435d12efd9ae9651683ae4d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4824dc021ec86d6d6ccfba6b_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "In addition to that, the editor will also display syntax errors and warnings such as unreachable code.",
      "sourceHash": "4824dc021ec86d6d6ccfba6b5154d80984942337e88cbd53621d5cb393383329",
      "context": "Scripting > Autocomplete & linting",
      "contextHash": "263bc05830d9e5b724d8ed55f90507179bd7161ab435d12efd9ae9651683ae4d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_412907a84684e67bb1b2a3f6_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "If you notice a false positive in regards with the errors/warnings reported or an incorrect or missing API, feel free to __TRILIUM_PH_0__open a issue__TRILIUM_PH_1__ with a code sample.",
      "sourceHash": "412907a84684e67bb1b2a3f6752fa4a824e5904eaf935259075e43ae59da265c",
      "context": "Scripting > Autocomplete & linting",
      "contextHash": "263bc05830d9e5b724d8ed55f90507179bd7161ab435d12efd9ae9651683ae4d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
